Definitive wire evidence, better than the thought-chunk count this was closed on. louiselm-wh2l wrongly claimed session/new is never logged; it is, in proxy/connections/<connection-id>.jsonl rather than the per-session file. The session/new request for the post-fix Session reads:

  { "cwd": "/home/lotso/code/louiselm", "mcpServers": [], "_meta": { "claudeCode": { "options": { "thinking": { "type": "adaptive", "display": "summarized" } } } } }

That is the structural confirmation this bug lacked at every earlier stage: the metadata is provably on the wire, not merely inferred from reading the installed plugin source. Connection 4c4aacc0-f68c-4103-a50c-89ab7e86c4ba, resolved from session 9f4fae89-a38b-4d73-be74-33cb34c9a4fc by grepping the connections directory for the session id, which the session_bound record makes possible.
